       "text_1": {
        "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
        "text": "<p>Analog Devices, Inc. (NASDAQ:&nbsp;<a href=\"https://apc01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Ffinance.yahoo.com%2Fq%3Fs%3DADI&amp;data=05%7C02%7CCarl.Dahlberg%40macnica.com%7C81edca398ac649b849d908dce6e103b0%7C88dda3740f00471ea2ad1727d0c0ffb6%7C0%7C0%7C638639101398311039%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=GnCxUzJ4G%2BSQBks%2F9gnJntnkOYbDlHj%2BCg4Xe7VGCiI%3D&amp;reserved=0\">ADI</a>) is a global semiconductor leader that bridges the physical and digital worlds to enable breakthroughs at the Intelligent Edge. ADI combines analog, digital, and software technologies into solutions that help drive advancements in digitized factories, mobility, and digital healthcare, combat climate change, and reliably connect humans and the world. With revenue of more than $12 billion in FY23 and approximately 26,000 people globally working alongside 125,000 global customers, ADI ensures today’s innovators stay Ahead of What’s Possible. Learn more&nbsp;&nbsp;Analog Devices products, componenents, and semiconductors at&nbsp;<a href=\"https://apc01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.analog.com%2Fen%2Findex.html&amp;data=05%7C02%7CCarl.Dahlberg%40macnica.com%7C81edca398ac649b849d908dce6e103b0%7C88dda3740f00471ea2ad1727d0c0ffb6%7C0%7C0%7C638639101398327836%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=9TBQk25vyTQlz2MmpOinl961AAUhOmvEWjFZB4vxQbc%3D&amp;reserved=0\">www.analog.com</a>&nbsp;and on&nbsp;<a href=\"https://apc01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.linkedin.com%2Fcompany%2Fanalog-devices&amp;data=05%7C02%7CCarl.Dahlberg%40macnica.com%7C81edca398ac649b849d908dce6e103b0%7C88dda3740f00471ea2ad1727d0c0ffb6%7C0%7C0%7C638639101398337718%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=3wLjJoJ%2BaCH4Y6ERK6upgmqSrjy6XFbHmxYtiJk5F1M%3D&amp;reserved=0\">LinkedIn</a> and&nbsp;<a href=\"https://apc01.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Ftwitter.com%2FADI_News&amp;data=05%7C02%7CCarl.Dahlberg%40macnica.com%7C81edca398ac649b849d908dce6e103b0%7C88dda3740f00471ea2ad1727d0c0ffb6%7C0%7C0%7C638639101398347909%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJWIjoiMC4wLjAwMDAiLCJQIjoiV2luMzIiLCJBTiI6Ik1haWwiLCJXVCI6Mn0%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=9G5uAk%2Ffi8alFf0kDUQHeWyD36%2FCbOd09YetAX90Z%2FA%3D&amp;reserved=0\">Twitter (X)</a>.</p>",
